{%- comment -%}
  VECTOR EDGE — Vehicle Designer v5
  Layered rebuild of the v4 van designer (templates/page.van-designer.liquid on
  the live theme). Same look, pricing, fitting and cart; new engine:
    - the vehicle, the design and the customer's elements are separate layers,
      so any design goes on any vehicle (v4 needed one Illustrator file per
      design per vehicle, and most designs only existed for the medium van)
    - one shared set of elements (logo, name, tagline, services list, phone,
      web, email, socials), each switched on/off once and kept when the design
      or vehicle changes; colours are kept per colour role, font is kept too
    - vehicles come from the existing outline sheets today and switch to
      PSD-exported photo layers per vehicle when they exist (see
      docs/van-designer-v5.md) — no change to designs needed
  Engine: assets/ve-vd5-engine.js · designs: assets/ve-vd5-library.js ·
  page logic: assets/ve-vd5-app.js
  Cart anchor: product 'custom-van-design' — one variant per possible total (£).
  Logo files cannot travel through cart/add.js; the filename is recorded and
  the customer sends the file after ordering, as in v4.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign vd_product = all_products['custom-van-design'] -%}

